{
  "$comment": [
    "Shared golden vectors for complex query-filter serialization (issue #246).",
    "Every SDK (Python, Java, Go, and later JS) asserts against THESE exact expected wire",
    "strings so the implementations cannot drift. Do not edit expected output to make a",
    "single SDK pass — fix the SDK. The contract is derived from the Kestra UI encoder",
    "(kestra#16197: ui/.../filter/utils/helpers.ts `encodeFilterGroupsToQuery`).",
    "",
    "Node shapes:",
    "  leaf  = {\"field\": <LOGICAL_ENUM_NAME>, \"op\": <OP>, \"value\": <string|[string]|{k:v}>}",
    "  group = {\"logical\": \"AND\"|\"OR\", \"children\": [node, ...]}",
    "Unified cross-SDK classification (issue #246 review): a node is a GROUP iff it",
    "has a logical OR a non-empty children list. A group with no logical defaults to",
    "AND. An empty children list on a leaf is ignored (the node stays a leaf). A node",
    "that carries both a field and group data is ambiguous and raises client-side.",
    "Case input is EITHER {\"where\": <node>} (built via the DSL where(...)) OR",
    "{\"list\": [node, ...]} (a raw filter list passed straight to the serializer, no DSL).",
    "",
    "Field name mapping is each SDK's existing concern (Java filterFieldName / Python enum",
    "value / Go SearchFilterField). The logical names below map to these wire names:",
    "  NAMESPACE->namespace  FLOW_ID->flowId  SCOPE->scope  STATE->state  LABELS->labels  QUERY->q",
    "",
    "`expected` is the ORDERED list of key=value pairs (values NOT percent-encoded here;",
    "each SDK compares against its own pre-escape representation).",
    "Serialization rules pinned:",
    "  - Top-level AND whose children are ALL leaves flattens to bare filters[field][OP]",
    "    (byte-identical to the legacy flat list — the key backward-compat invariant).",
    "  - Explicit filters[and][i]/filters[or][i] appears only when a nested group is present",
    "    or the top logical is OR.",
    "  - A group with exactly one child flattens to that child.",
    "  - An empty group emits nothing.",
    "  - IN / NOT_IN values are CSV-joined.",
    "  - Map/LABELS values emit a [key] suffix.",
    "  - Nesting is one level deep max; deeper must raise a client-side error (tested per-SDK)."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "flat_single_leaf",
      "input": { "where": { "field": "FLOW_ID", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "my-flow" } },
      "expected": ["filters[flowId][EQUALS]=my-flow"]
    },
    {
      "name": "flat_and_of_leaves_via_where",
      "input": { "where": { "logical": "AND", "children": [
        { "field": "NAMESPACE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "ns" },
        { "field": "FLOW_ID", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "f" }
      ] } },
      "expected": [
        "filters[namespace][EQUALS]=ns",
        "filters[flowId][EQUALS]=f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "raw_flat_list_backward_compat",
      "input": { "list": [
        { "field": "NAMESPACE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "ns" },
        { "field": "FLOW_ID", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "f" }
      ] },
      "expected": [
        "filters[namespace][EQUALS]=ns",
        "filters[flowId][EQUALS]=f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "top_level_or",
      "input": { "where": { "logical": "OR", "children": [
        { "field": "SCOPE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "s1" },
        { "field": "SCOPE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "s2" }
      ] } },
      "expected": [
        "filters[or][0][scope][EQUALS]=s1",
        "filters[or][1][scope][EQUALS]=s2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "and_containing_or",
      "input": { "where": { "logical": "AND", "children": [
        { "field": "NAMESPACE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "ns" },
        { "logical": "OR", "children": [
          { "field": "SCOPE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "s1" },
          { "field": "SCOPE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "s2" }
        ] }
      ] } },
      "expected": [
        "filters[and][0][namespace][EQUALS]=ns",
        "filters[and][1][or][0][scope][EQUALS]=s1",
        "filters[and][1][or][1][scope][EQUALS]=s2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "or_containing_and",
      "input": { "where": { "logical": "OR", "children": [
        { "field": "NAMESPACE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "ns" },
        { "logical": "AND", "children": [
          { "field": "SCOPE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "s1" },
          { "field": "FLOW_ID", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "f" }
        ] }
      ] } },
      "expected": [
        "filters[or][0][namespace][EQUALS]=ns",
        "filters[or][1][and][0][scope][EQUALS]=s1",
        "filters[or][1][and][1][flowId][EQUALS]=f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "single_child_group_flattens",
      "input": { "where": { "logical": "OR", "children": [
        { "field": "SCOPE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "s1" }
      ] } },
      "expected": ["filters[scope][EQUALS]=s1"]
    },
    {
      "name": "empty_group_emits_nothing",
      "input": { "where": { "logical": "AND", "children": [] } },
      "expected": []
    },
    {
      "name": "in_operator_csv_flat",
      "input": { "where": { "field": "STATE", "op": "IN", "value": ["RUNNING", "SUCCESS"] } },
      "expected": ["filters[state][IN]=RUNNING,SUCCESS"]
    },
    {
      "name": "in_operator_csv_inside_or",
      "input": { "where": { "logical": "OR", "children": [
        { "field": "NAMESPACE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "ns" },
        { "field": "STATE", "op": "IN", "value": ["RUNNING", "SUCCESS"] }
      ] } },
      "expected": [
        "filters[or][0][namespace][EQUALS]=ns",
        "filters[or][1][state][IN]=RUNNING,SUCCESS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "labels_map_value_inside_and_or",
      "input": { "where": { "logical": "AND", "children": [
        { "field": "NAMESPACE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "ns" },
        { "logical": "OR", "children": [
          { "field": "LABELS", "op": "EQUALS", "value": { "env": "prod" } },
          { "field": "SCOPE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "s1" }
        ] }
      ] } },
      "expected": [
        "filters[and][0][namespace][EQUALS]=ns",
        "filters[and][1][or][0][labels][EQUALS][env]=prod",
        "filters[and][1][or][1][scope][EQUALS]=s1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "query_field_maps_to_q",
      "input": { "where": { "field": "QUERY", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "hello" } },
      "expected": ["filters[q][EQUALS]=hello"]
    },
    {
      "name": "group_without_logical_defaults_to_and",
      "input": { "list": [ { "children": [
        { "field": "NAMESPACE", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "ns" },
        { "field": "FLOW_ID", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "f" }
      ] } ] },
      "expected": [
        "filters[namespace][EQUALS]=ns",
        "filters[flowId][EQUALS]=f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "leaf_with_empty_children_is_leaf",
      "input": { "list": [
        { "field": "FLOW_ID", "op": "EQUALS", "value": "f", "children": [] }
      ] },
      "expected": ["filters[flowId][EQUALS]=f"]
    }
  ]
}
